      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 7,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "title": "How to use",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Long recordings / SenseVoice\n\n> **Change `Media Input -> path` before queueing.** `video.mp4` is only a placeholder. It fails until that file exists in `ComfyUI/input` (or you switch to a direct URL).\n\nThis variant adds VAD before transcription.\n\n- **VAD** uses the ffmpeg backend and cuts speech at pauses, with regions capped at 30 s.\n- **FunASR** runs `iic/SenseVoiceSmall` (fast, zh/en/yue/ja/ko) on each region. SenseVoice returns no timestamps, so the VAD regions provide the SRT timing (one cue per region).\n- For sentence-level Chinese timing, use the other starter (`paraformer-zh`, no VAD).\n\n## Tuning\n- Noisy room: raise `threshold_db` toward 0.\n- Quiet speech: lower `threshold_db`.\n- Long monologue: raise `max_segment_seconds` (VAD and FunASR).\n- `write_chunks` on VAD keeps each region as a WAV for inspection.\n\n## Output\n`ComfyUI/output/transcribe/chinese_transcript_vad.srt`\n\nChange **Format Transcript -> format** to `txt`, `json` or `vtt` as needed.\n"
      ]
    }
